*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cli-One]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
