**6 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Bring cats such as [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]] and [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] to constantly deal damage to the backliner enemies like Angelic Sleipnir, the Sir Rels and the M. Ost. Save up money at the start by slowly killing the Mr. Angels, preferably with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], or any unit with a double money bounty talent. When your wallet is at Lv6 or 7, hit the base and spawn Awakened Ururun and Mina, together with a continuous stream of [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapsticks]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragons]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragons]] (or any other Long Ranger you have). Your cats should be able to slowly kill off the M. Ost. When he dies, the Cli-One shouldn't pose much of a threat, destroy the base and win.

